<item><title>Libya&apos;s central bank governor urges a unified national budget</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-s-central-bank-governor-urges-a-unified-national-89932b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-s-central-bank-governor-urges-a-unified-national-89932b/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>Fawzi Abu Khazam told Finance Minister Rashid Abu Ghaffa that a single budget would consolidate public spending and strengthen fiscal discipline.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:12:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" length="30956" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
