<item><title>Libyan government warns it will reorganise regional administration after Zintan session...</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-government-warns-it-will-reorganise-regional-26b7c4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-government-warns-it-will-reorganise-regional-26b7c4/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>The government says it will act if obstruction of the House of Representatives continues, giving regions more authority over their administration, finances and public resources.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:23:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-government-warns-it-will-reorganise-regional-26b7c4/share.jpg" length="43754" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libyan-government-warns-it-will-reorganise-regional-26b7c4/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
